  "text": "The KV_MAPPING.md file has inconsistent MP4 URL examples:\n- Line 93 shows: `https://vz-12345.b-cdn.net/guid-1234/original.mp4` \n- Line 157 shows: `https://vz-12345.b-cdn.net/{videoId}/original.mp4`\n\nBut these use `vz-xxxxx.b-cdn.net` which is a different CDN domain than `stream.divine.video`. The `original.mp4` format might be an old/alternative BunnyStream URL format, or it could be documentation that needs updating to match the play_{resolution}p.mp4 format we're actually using.\n\nNeed to clarify with Rabble if this is intentional or if KV_MAPPING.md is outdated.",
